title: Thread Execution Hijacking
id: 3c86cf1b-2b8f-4c38-b623-22e62bfd68fe
status: experimental
description: Detects thread execution hijacking, where a source process opens a thread in a target with SUSPEND/SET_CONTEXT access (Sysmon event 10 GrantedAccess 0x1800 class) to redirect it to injected code.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/003/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_access
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 10
    GrantedAccess|contains:
      - '0x1800'
      - '0x1fffff'
    CallTrace|contains: 'SetThreadContext'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SourceImage
  - TargetImage
  - GrantedAccess
falsepositives:
  - Debuggers
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1055.003
